                    Short. Memorable. Brandable.
                    <br>
                    A curated portfolio of premium .IN domains for businesses, brands and startups.
                  </p>

                  <div class="go7-home-button">
                    <a href="/domains" class="btn btn-primary btn-round text-uppercase">
                      Explore Domains
                    </a>
                  </div>

                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div class="go7-home-space"></div>
